WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:06.813
Tina: How do you know all this?

2
00:00:13.115 --> 00:00:14.255
Tristay told me.

3
00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:16.836
All three: Tristay told you?

4
00:00:17.276 --> 00:00:18.556
How? When?

5
00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:22.517
Hopian: It was soon after things started to turn gray.

6
00:00:22.537 --> 00:00:25.318
Hopian: Tristay came to see me.

7
00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:28.519
I almost didn’t recognize him.

8
00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:31.460
Hopian: He showed me his new power.

9
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:35.929
Hopian: He said that he would change Ginormous forever.

10
00:00:35.949 --> 00:00:40.030
Hopian: It was horrible to see someone so evil!

11
00:00:43.691 --> 00:00:45.291
I want to stop this guy!

12
00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.612
Tina: Me too!

13
00:00:46.632 --> 00:00:48.292
Brad: I’m ready!

14
00:00:48.312 --> 00:00:50.873
Tina: So what’s our first step?

15
00:00:50.893 --> 00:00:56.354
Danny: We started our adventure with blue, so let’s start with blue here.

16
00:00:56.374 --> 00:00:59.355
Tina: We could put the blue back in the ocean.

17
00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:02.236
Hopian: That’s an excellent idea.

18
00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:06.172
Danny: Okay.

19
00:01:06.552 --> 00:01:07.713
Is everybody ready?

20
00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:10.054
Hopian: You three go on ahead.

21
00:01:10.074 --> 00:01:14.596
Hopian: I must take Bello to his grandparents', where he will be safe.

22
00:01:15.236 --> 00:01:17.297
Danny: We might need your help, Hopian.

23
00:01:17.317 --> 00:01:19.398
Hopian: I’ll be there soon.

24
00:01:19.418 --> 00:01:22.019
Brad: Wait!

25
00:01:22.039 --> 00:01:23.339
Danny: What?

26
00:01:23.359 --> 00:01:25.980
Brad: How do we get to the ocean?

27
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.502
Hopian: Follow the little bug.

28
00:01:30.282 --> 00:01:32.443
Tina: There it is!

29
00:01:32.463 --> 00:01:35.044
Danny: Which way to the ocean?

30
00:01:37.888 --> 00:01:38.809
Hopian: Be careful!

31
00:01:38.829 --> 00:01:49.275
All three: Hopian: Bello, it’s time to get up.

32
00:01:50.155 --> 00:01:50.736
Wake up.

33
00:01:51.556 --> 00:01:54.138
Hopian: We have to go to your grandparents' house.

34
00:01:55.238 --> 00:01:56.519
Hopian: Bello?

35
00:02:02.082 --> 00:02:04.143
Bello? Where did he go?

36
00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:13.256
Hopian: Bello!

37
00:02:13.276 --> 00:02:16.037
Bello! BELLLOOO!

38
00:02:16.077 --> 00:02:21.239
Tina: I think I see the ocean, just past those hills.

39
00:02:21.259 --> 00:02:23.959
Danny: Thank you, bug.

40
00:02:24.339 --> 00:02:26.180
You can go back to Hopian now.

41
00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:31.761
Brad: Are we there yet?

42
00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:36.523
Danny: Guys, it sounds like something is following us!

43
00:02:36.863 --> 00:02:40.704
Brad: Quick, let’s hide behind this rock.

44
00:02:42.732 --> 00:02:45.353
Danny: If it’s Tristay, I’m ready to fight.

45
00:02:48.955 --> 00:02:50.135
Danny: Bello!

46
00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:51.516
What are you doing here?

47
00:02:51.536 --> 00:02:55.458
Tina: Bello, you shouldn’t be here.

48
00:03:05.322 --> 00:03:08.164
None of you should be here!

49
00:03:13.324 --> 00:03:14.885
Danny: I’ll get you, Tristay!

50
00:03:15.385 --> 00:03:16.086
Where are you?

51
00:03:16.106 --> 00:03:17.847
Tina: Yeah!

52
00:03:18.127 --> 00:03:19.167
Show your face!

53
00:03:19.187 --> 00:03:24.510
Tristay: Oh, I’ll show you my face all right.

54
00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:27.112
You’re coming to me!
